    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. specifically regarding the semi-metallic ones, i'm worried about the heat soak causing some irregular performance or the pads \"acting up\" when they get way too hot. can you explain the mechanics of why a pad might become inconsistent or behave unpredictably during those high-temp cycles?",
